</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bddd2032-0bde-11ea-9862-005056bff430/w:1024/p:16x9/fa_guo_shi_jie_bao_wb161923-rfi-cn-20150123_cartouche.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bddd2032-0bde-11ea-9862-005056bff430/w:1024/p:16x9/fa_guo_shi_jie_bao_wb161923-rfi-cn-20150123_cartouche.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">6c2152b0-7737-11f1-9a9b-d10ca4326750</guid><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 23:32:27 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>阿曼亭</dc:creator></item><item><category>美洲</category><title>法媒：美判与特朗普身边一些权势建立政商联系的郭文贵30年徒刑</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E7%BE%8E%E6%B4%B2/20260630-%E6%B3%95%E5%AA%92-%E7%BE%8E%E5%88%A4%E4%B8%8E%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E8%BA%AB%E8%BE%B9%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%BF%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E6%94%BF%E5%95%86%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E9%83%AD%E6%96%87%E8%B4%B530%E5%B9%B4%E5%BE%92%E5%88%91</link><description>
